{"version":1,"id":"metallica-turn-the-page","title":"Turn The Page","artist":"Metallica","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/metallica/turn-the-page/?instrument=keyboard","spotifyUrl":"https://open.spotify.com/track/7HPhrbgMHV5cUskknWA2oo","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Bob Seger","chords":[{"symbol":"D#m","canonical":"D#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,6,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#","canonical":"C#","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G#","canonical":"G#","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,0,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Intro]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":" On a long and lonesome highway east of omaha","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":" You can listen to the engine, moaning out it's one note song","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":" You  think about the woman, or the girl you knew the night before","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":" But your thoughts will soon be wondering the way they always do","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":" When you're riding sixteen hours and there's nothing much to do","columns":64,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":" And you don't feel much like riding you just wish the trip was","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":" Through","columns":8,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":" Here I am, on the road again","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":" There I am, up on the stage","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":" There I go, playing  star again","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":" There I go, turn the page","columns":27,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#m","column":24,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":" So you walk into this restaraunt, strung out from the road","columns":59,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":" And you feel the eyes upon you, as you're shaking off the cold","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":" You pretend it doesn't bother you, but you just want to explode","columns":67,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":64,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":" Yeah,most times you can't hear 'em talk, other times you can","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":" All the same old cliche's is it woman is it man","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":" And you always seem outnumbered, you don't dare make a stand","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":59,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":" Make your stand","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":" Here I am, on the road again","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":" There I am, up on the stage","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":" Here I go, playing  star again","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":" There I go, turn the page       Oh...Oh","columns":40,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#m","column":24,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":" Out there in the spotlight, you're a million miles away","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":" Every ounce of energy, you try and give away","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":" As the sweat poors out your body, like the music that you play","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":62,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":" Later in the evening, as you lie awake in bed","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":" With the echoes of the amplifiers, ringin in your head","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":" You smoke the days last cigarette, remembering what she said","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":59,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":" What she said     (D Em)","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","